    <item>
      <title>AI 本身不會改變你的業務。真正改變它的是運作它的系統。</title>
      <link>https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/06/02/ai-alone-wont-change-your-business-the-system-running-it-will/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://blogs.microsoft.com/?p=52562973</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 02 Jun 2026 19:00:13 GMT</pubDate>
      <source url="https://blogs.microsoft.com/feed/">The Official Microsoft Blog</source>
      <dc:creator>The Official Microsoft Blog</dc:creator>
